=base:main-content.cmark

# Changelog: tramaj-halogen

Release history of `tramaj-halogen`, the Halogen host: folds an evaluated Node into Halogen.HTML. Releases happen when there are
major changes rather than on a schedule; each entry below is one version.
Every implementation has its own page like this one, and each page is
tagged so the site builds one Atom feed per implementation:
#changelog #purescript #tramaj-halogen

=base:main-content.tramaj-doc
@version=import("changelog/version", {"package": "tramaj-halogen"})
.div(class: "changelog",
  $version({
      "version": "(none)",
      "date": "unreleased",
      "summary": "Consumed as a git dependency; no registry release yet.",
      "changes": [
          {
              "kind": "added",
              "text": "\`Tramaj.Halogen.foldToHalogen\`, wiring each \`action(...)\` to the host's own Action type."
          }
      ]
  }).rendered)

